      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I'd give it a five, out of ten. It's a couple of times a week. Okay, so I've been passing a lot of urine too, for three days. And deep fast breathing, too. As for deep fast breathing, it's severe, honestly. I, I had tummy pain before. That's settled now, though.",
